WEBVTT

00:00:19.728 --> 00:00:21.479
Don't shoot him.

00:00:21.479 --> 00:00:24.524
Please forgive him!

00:00:27.193 --> 00:00:32.073
Until your official punishment is decided,
I forbid you from leaving your dorm.

00:00:33.992 --> 00:00:35.827
Is that all?

00:00:37.829 --> 00:00:39.122
Is it really okay?!

00:00:39.122 --> 00:00:42.250
Don't you have to send me to the
detention barrack like Cayenne?!

00:00:42.250 --> 00:00:44.586
Or is this some sort of training, too?!

00:00:44.586 --> 00:00:46.463
Mikono Suzushiro...

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:54.596
What happened to me?

00:01:07.317 --> 00:01:11.821
<i>Zetsubou teki ni kimi wa kirei sa</i>

00:01:11.821 --> 00:01:19.871
<i>Hanten suru sekai no platonic aishi aou</i>

00:01:26.127 --> 00:01:36.513
<i>Bokura ga miteru sekai wa</i>
<i>itsu demo sakasama de</i>

00:01:36.513 --> 00:01:45.480
<i>Doushiyou mo nai koto de taigai kimatteku</i>

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:51.111
<i>Namida suru hodo kizutsuku hitomi</i>

00:01:51.111 --> 00:01:57.367
<i>Kokoro de sakebi nagara damatte ita</i>

00:01:57.367 --> 00:02:09.462
<i>Saigo no futari mazare nai</i>
<i>mama byouyomi ga kikoetekuru</i>

00:02:09.462 --> 00:02:14.092
<i>Zetsubou teki ni kimi wa kirei sa</i>

00:02:14.092 --> 00:02:19.973
<i>Sutare yuku doubutsu mitai ni aishi aou</i>

00:02:19.973 --> 00:02:24.477
<i>Nakitai kurai kimi wa kirei sa</i>

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:30.567
<i>Hanten suru sekai no platonic kanjitai yo</i>

00:02:39.951 --> 00:02:45.373
"Soul's Confession"
Mikono... Do you remember Jin's voice that we heard at the cemetery?

00:02:45.373 --> 00:02:46.499
Yeah.

00:02:46.499 --> 00:02:49.294
When I heard it, I thought that...

00:02:49.294 --> 00:02:55.467
...I could be with Jin forever,
as long as I remembered him.

00:02:55.467 --> 00:03:00.472
I thought I'd try my best to live my
life together with Jin's memories.

00:03:00.472 --> 00:03:02.223
Yunoha...

00:03:02.223 --> 00:03:05.477
Although that training was strange,
I guess it was worth going through it.

00:03:05.477 --> 00:03:08.980
It was you, Mikono, who helped me realize it.

00:03:08.980 --> 00:03:10.774
What?

00:03:10.774 --> 00:03:14.819
Although I'm like this,
you said that I was dear to you.

00:03:16.446 --> 00:03:20.075
This time, it's my turn to be your support.

00:03:20.075 --> 00:03:24.162
You're dear to me, too.

00:03:24.162 --> 00:03:25.705
Yunoha...

00:03:27.874 --> 00:03:29.417
Thank you.

00:03:31.211 --> 00:03:32.253
Mikono...

00:03:32.253 --> 00:03:35.924
I'm happy for you, though it
wasn't you who helped her.

00:03:37.175 --> 00:03:42.013
I wonder why I did that... It's strange.

00:03:42.013 --> 00:03:44.808
I don't even understand myself.

00:03:44.808 --> 00:03:50.021
It's okay. No one completely
understands themselves.

00:03:50.021 --> 00:03:51.398
Yeah...

00:03:51.398 --> 00:03:55.151
But there are tons of things I don't understand.

00:03:55.151 --> 00:03:56.945
About that, too...

00:04:00.073 --> 00:04:02.742
Do you want to say... Mikono is Silffy?

00:04:02.742 --> 00:04:07.288
Right, and he's Apollon.

00:04:09.416 --> 00:04:10.792
What's the matter?

00:04:10.792 --> 00:04:13.294
No... Nothing.

00:04:15.463 --> 00:04:19.009
Oh, yeah, speaking of strange things...

00:04:19.009 --> 00:04:24.222
Shushu doesn't take to anyone but me,
but she strangely took to him.

00:04:24.222 --> 00:04:28.184
I wonder if that's the reason... why he
didn't appear to be a bad person to me.

00:04:33.690 --> 00:04:35.025
You're right.

00:04:35.025 --> 00:04:39.779
Amata gets even worse treatment.
He could get scratched all over his face.

00:04:44.367 --> 00:04:50.165
When I look back on it, from the
moment we met, Shushu didn't like me.

00:04:50.165 --> 00:04:55.003
I wonder if it means that
I'm not good for Mikono...

00:04:55.003 --> 00:04:58.089
Well, it might.

00:04:58.089 --> 00:05:00.759
It's fate, so to speak...

00:05:00.759 --> 00:05:04.679
It's like the fate in which
Mix and I are linked by holes.

00:05:04.679 --> 00:05:08.558
You were fated to be disliked by Shushu
and to be defeated by that wolf guy

00:05:08.558 --> 00:05:11.102
in the battle of love.

00:05:11.102 --> 00:05:12.687
Just kidding.

00:05:17.817 --> 00:05:22.530
Was everything really decided
twelve thousand years ago?

00:05:22.530 --> 00:05:25.033
Boy, you're distressed, aren't you, Amata?

00:05:25.033 --> 00:05:28.995
Then, "if you want to shoot
the general, first shoot his horse."

00:05:28.995 --> 00:05:31.998
Why don't you start with taming Shushu?

00:05:31.998 --> 00:05:33.500
What?

00:05:35.210 --> 00:05:37.629
It's 3,450 Kowloon.

00:05:37.629 --> 00:05:39.589
Okay.

00:05:39.589 --> 00:05:41.174
Let's see...

00:05:42.258 --> 00:05:46.429
I bought stuff that Shushu
might like as a first step...

00:05:46.429 --> 00:05:50.183
...but it wouldn't solve anything, would it...?

00:05:52.977 --> 00:05:55.480
Today's training was tiring!

00:05:55.480 --> 00:05:56.981
I'm exhausted!

00:05:56.981 --> 00:05:59.651
That teacher talks a lot!

00:06:04.322 --> 00:06:05.782
Whoa...

00:06:05.782 --> 00:06:09.244
--Whoa! Amazing!
--What happened?

00:06:09.244 --> 00:06:10.787
Now I did it...

00:06:10.787 --> 00:06:12.372
What'd you do?

00:06:12.372 --> 00:06:15.083
Oh, nothing!

00:06:15.083 --> 00:06:18.420
Hey, can I ask you something?

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:21.339
When I've said something
that I shouldn't have to someone,

00:06:21.339 --> 00:06:23.508
how can I make it right?

00:06:23.508 --> 00:06:25.719
I don't think you need to.

00:06:25.719 --> 00:06:28.471
Instead of smoothing it over,
you should say it clearly!

00:06:28.471 --> 00:06:30.557
It's best for them to know how you feel!

00:06:30.557 --> 00:06:32.934
I-Is that right?

00:06:32.934 --> 00:06:35.020
Why don't you stop holding back and say...

00:06:35.020 --> 00:06:37.188
..."I hate you!"?

00:06:37.188 --> 00:06:38.189
Huh?

00:06:38.189 --> 00:06:42.193
We should always deal with guys resolutely!

00:06:42.193 --> 00:06:46.656
Oh, shoot! I'm supposed to
meet up with Andy! See ya!

00:06:46.656 --> 00:06:51.786
"See ya"? Hey, you didn't answer
my question at all! Geez...!

00:07:03.006 --> 00:07:06.134
Area 337 again?

00:07:06.134 --> 00:07:08.386
Handle it swiftly.

00:07:08.386 --> 00:07:12.182
Of course, the citizens' safety comes first.

00:07:12.182 --> 00:07:13.558
Roger.

00:07:13.558 --> 00:07:18.063
The Iron Sea was created by my mother, Oriza.

00:07:18.063 --> 00:07:23.985
It's a system that promised
this world prosperity and peace.

00:07:23.985 --> 00:07:29.074
Despite that, the power output has
decreased due to an unknown cause,

00:07:29.074 --> 00:07:31.326
the control system is experiencing errors,

00:07:31.326 --> 00:07:34.829
and explosions are happening frequently.

00:07:34.829 --> 00:07:40.001
No system lasts forever. I understand that.

00:07:40.001 --> 00:07:43.296
But this is happening way too soon.

00:07:44.756 --> 00:07:46.633
Jin...

00:07:46.633 --> 00:07:51.221
Is this the beginning of Altair's end?

00:07:51.221 --> 00:07:55.684
Or... am I being punished?

00:07:58.395 --> 00:08:00.188
Real combat training?!

00:08:00.188 --> 00:08:03.274
Yes. It's a proposal by Fudo.

00:08:03.274 --> 00:08:06.778
It's too dangerous to have two
Aquarions fight each other!

00:08:06.778 --> 00:08:11.825
Life and death are always
two sides of the same coin.

00:08:11.825 --> 00:08:14.786
They've survived the Grave Training.

00:08:14.786 --> 00:08:17.372
They should be able to learn
from all sorts of dangers

00:08:17.372 --> 00:08:20.375
and evolve to the next level.

00:08:21.376 --> 00:08:25.130
The battle is expected to
further intensify in the future.

00:08:25.130 --> 00:08:27.966
If they are to be able to
overcome more difficult situations,

00:08:27.966 --> 00:08:30.760
they must undergo this training.

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:32.762
Understood.

00:08:32.762 --> 00:08:36.057
How should we go about determining
the Element combinations?

00:08:36.057 --> 00:08:38.768
It's already been decided.

00:08:38.768 --> 00:08:40.687
Cayenne Suzushiro.

00:08:40.687 --> 00:08:43.982
I never imagined that we'd have
a battle sim between Aquarions.

00:08:43.982 --> 00:08:46.151
Sazanka Bianca.

00:08:46.151 --> 00:08:50.447
Gattai with Cayenne?!
Could the other member be Shrade?!

00:08:50.447 --> 00:08:52.574
Malloy Drezza.

00:08:52.574 --> 00:08:54.701
Well, I'm sorry for being chosen!

00:08:54.701 --> 00:08:55.702
"Against"

00:08:55.702 --> 00:09:00.123
"Against"
And they'll fight against Amata, Zessica, and Mikono.

00:09:00.123 --> 00:09:03.418
Everything has been decided by fate.

00:09:03.418 --> 00:09:05.295
Is it really true?

00:09:10.717 --> 00:09:14.679
All the Vector machines have
arrived in the battlefield space.

00:09:14.679 --> 00:09:17.182
Team Cayenne, merge to
become Aquarion Gepart!

00:09:17.182 --> 00:09:18.767
Roger!

00:09:18.767 --> 00:09:21.186
Team Amata, merge to become Aquarion Evol!

00:09:21.186 --> 00:09:22.687
Roger!

00:09:26.733 --> 00:09:28.526
Kunren Gattai!

00:09:28.526 --> 00:09:31.571
Go! Aquarion!

00:09:39.245 --> 00:09:41.956
Aquarion Gepart!

00:09:44.209 --> 00:09:46.670
Aquarion Evol!

00:09:52.759 --> 00:09:55.887
Both Aquarions are permitted
to use Element powers freely!

00:09:55.887 --> 00:09:57.681
The one standing before you is your enemy!

00:09:57.681 --> 00:10:00.308
Keep that in mind and
fight with all your strength!

00:10:00.308 --> 00:10:01.685
Amata...

00:10:01.685 --> 00:10:07.440
I'll see whether or not you have
what it takes to protect Mikono!

00:10:15.198 --> 00:10:16.199
Amata!

00:10:16.199 --> 00:10:18.159
We're at a disadvantage from this distance!

00:10:18.159 --> 00:10:20.245
We'll use the buildings as shields and close in!

00:10:21.538 --> 00:10:24.416
Malloy...

00:10:34.134 --> 00:10:35.176
What?!

00:10:35.176 --> 00:10:37.137
The buildings fell like sand castles!

00:10:37.137 --> 00:10:41.391
This is my Element power that was
strengthened in the Grave Training.

00:10:41.391 --> 00:10:44.436
I guess you've never seen it so closely, huh?

00:10:47.397 --> 00:10:48.773
Atrophy Power...

00:10:48.773 --> 00:10:52.652
This power removes the bond
between the molecules of materials

00:10:52.652 --> 00:10:55.905
in order to make them brittle.

00:10:59.576 --> 00:11:01.327
Too bad!

00:11:01.327 --> 00:11:03.663
Shields are pointless!

00:11:08.585 --> 00:11:11.171
Mikono, hang in there.

00:11:18.136 --> 00:11:21.139
Amata! Let's fall back for now and regroup!

00:11:21.139 --> 00:11:24.017
That would be just what Gepart wants!

00:11:25.018 --> 00:11:26.603
If we can make it there...

00:11:26.603 --> 00:11:28.813
Amata! We can't win if we keep running away!

00:11:28.813 --> 00:11:31.983
He knows that! But for now, we have to...

00:11:31.983 --> 00:11:33.985
Both of you, be quiet for a bit!

00:11:39.199 --> 00:11:42.243
Gepart is optimized for long-range battles.

00:11:42.243 --> 00:11:44.788
They should keep their distance from us.

00:11:46.164 --> 00:11:48.166
--Amata!
--Amata! Behind you!

00:11:53.004 --> 00:11:54.547
You're careless, Amata!

00:11:54.547 --> 00:12:00.095
With Atrophy Power, shots can
easily open a hole in the ground!

00:12:00.095 --> 00:12:04.182
That darn Malloy! Holes are my specialty!

00:12:05.183 --> 00:12:08.687
Mugen Punch!

00:12:08.687 --> 00:12:10.105
Evol's balance is...

00:12:10.105 --> 00:12:11.439
Look!

00:12:11.439 --> 00:12:14.192
Evol's legs are... rusting!

00:12:16.069 --> 00:12:19.114
My Element power is Corrosion Power.

00:12:21.700 --> 00:12:25.328
It corrodes materials and makes them rot away.

00:12:29.541 --> 00:12:31.042
Here is the finishing blow!

00:12:32.043 --> 00:12:34.671
Mugen Punch!

00:12:41.094 --> 00:12:45.765
You've got some guts to put distance
between us when fighting Gepart.

00:12:45.765 --> 00:12:48.143
The corrosion of the legs stopped,

00:12:48.143 --> 00:12:50.061
but we have to be careful about
getting closer in this situation.

00:12:50.061 --> 00:12:52.147
Give it up, Amata!

00:12:52.147 --> 00:12:56.151
You guys had no chance of winning
this battle sim from the start!

00:12:56.151 --> 00:12:58.778
You could call this fate!

00:12:58.778 --> 00:13:00.155
Fate?

00:13:00.155 --> 00:13:02.365
Stop fighting and admit your loss!

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:10.582
What?!

00:13:11.708 --> 00:13:15.587
Don't tell me... Are they reading our actions?

00:13:15.587 --> 00:13:17.005
What do you think, Amata?!

00:13:17.005 --> 00:13:21.760
If they weren't sim bullets,
Evol would've been Swiss cheese by now!

00:13:21.760 --> 00:13:23.762
Cayenne's Despair Prediction...

00:13:23.762 --> 00:13:25.597
It seems that it's been further sharpened

00:13:25.597 --> 00:13:29.934
and now he can foresee a few seconds ahead.

00:13:29.934 --> 00:13:34.481
Thanks to the Grave Training,
his basic aura level has increased, too.

00:13:34.481 --> 00:13:36.900
If Cayenne's Instant Prediction is added

00:13:36.900 --> 00:13:39.652
to Gepart's firearm control system...

00:13:39.652 --> 00:13:43.448
...it's possible to fire by reading
the enemy's actions ahead of time!

00:13:43.448 --> 00:13:44.908
Seriously...?!

00:13:44.908 --> 00:13:48.536
Jin, please protect Mikono and the others.

00:13:49.621 --> 00:13:52.332
Now, where are you gonna show up from?

00:13:52.332 --> 00:13:58.296
Right? Left? Or from above?
I'll read your actions!

00:13:58.296 --> 00:14:01.049
I'll see the fate in which you lose the battle!

00:14:03.051 --> 00:14:09.265
No... Losing against fate...
I'll never accept that!

00:14:09.265 --> 00:14:11.393
--Amata...
--Amata...

00:14:11.393 --> 00:14:18.733
Even if everything was decided
twelve thousand years ago, I... I...

00:14:18.733 --> 00:14:21.319
I want to resist that fate!

00:14:22.821 --> 00:14:25.281
Amata's right.

00:14:25.281 --> 00:14:26.574
Zessica!

00:14:26.574 --> 00:14:31.121
I told you about the image
I saw in a mirror, right?

00:14:31.121 --> 00:14:33.164
I thought that was fate.

00:14:33.164 --> 00:14:36.710
But I forgot something more important.

00:14:36.710 --> 00:14:42.257
What's really important is not fate
but the truth of our current selves...

00:14:42.257 --> 00:14:46.845
The feelings that breathe
in our hearts right now!

00:14:46.845 --> 00:14:49.848
Instead of smoothing it over,
you should say it clearly!

00:14:51.891 --> 00:14:54.769
I feel that I can say it now.

00:14:55.854 --> 00:14:58.273
You can say what, Zessica?

00:15:00.692 --> 00:15:02.527
Listen, Amata...

00:15:02.527 --> 00:15:04.029
Yeah?

00:15:05.655 --> 00:15:08.700
I'm in... I'm in...

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:11.077
Looks like they even lost the will to fight.

00:15:11.077 --> 00:15:13.371
"Corrosion... Corrosion... Corrosion..."
Looks like they even lost the will to fight.

00:15:13.371 --> 00:15:16.374
Then... this will finish them off!

00:15:20.712 --> 00:15:22.922
Go!

00:15:29.679 --> 00:15:33.725
I'm in... I'm in...

00:15:33.725 --> 00:15:37.062
...love... with you!

00:15:39.606 --> 00:15:41.900
That was close.

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:44.361
Sorry, Zessica. What did you just say?

00:15:44.361 --> 00:15:48.114
--What?
--I couldn't hear it, either, because of the blast sound.

00:15:48.114 --> 00:15:49.783
What?!

00:15:49.783 --> 00:15:52.786
It's important, right? Say it one more time.

00:15:52.786 --> 00:15:54.788
We'll make sure to listen this time.

00:15:57.749 --> 00:15:59.250
Huh?

00:16:02.212 --> 00:16:04.047
I'm in...

00:16:04.047 --> 00:16:08.718
...love with you, Amata.

00:16:08.718 --> 00:16:10.178
What?

00:16:10.178 --> 00:16:14.766
I'm in love with Amata!

00:16:18.103 --> 00:16:20.563
--In...
--In...

00:16:20.563 --> 00:16:21.940
In love?!

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:23.316
In love...

00:16:23.316 --> 00:16:24.776
In love...?

00:16:24.776 --> 00:16:26.486
--In love...
--In love...!

00:16:26.486 --> 00:16:28.571
--In love...
--In love...

00:16:33.618 --> 00:16:38.873
In love!

00:16:38.873 --> 00:16:41.960
--U-Um...
--Oh, I said it.

00:16:41.960 --> 00:16:44.921
Z... Zessica?

00:16:49.134 --> 00:16:50.927
--What's going on?!
--Evol is...

00:16:50.927 --> 00:16:52.470
...shining!

00:16:58.935 --> 00:17:00.645
"Skyrocketing"

00:17:01.312 --> 00:17:05.150
The emotion gauge inside Evol
is increasing tremendously!

00:17:05.150 --> 00:17:08.445
--Is this...
--...Zessica's passionate one-sided love?

00:17:08.445 --> 00:17:11.322
This is bad! Even if it's not mutual love,

00:17:11.322 --> 00:17:15.827
if the love is too passionate,
it can drive Aquarion out of control!

00:17:15.827 --> 00:17:20.331
Well, I don't know what to say.
I do appreciate your feeling.

00:17:20.331 --> 00:17:21.833
Amata?!

00:17:21.916 --> 00:17:22.459
"Fluster"

00:17:22.459 --> 00:17:23.126
"Jealousy"

00:17:29.716 --> 00:17:31.843
Evol is moving on its own!

00:17:47.859 --> 00:17:49.110
Mugen Punch...

00:17:49.110 --> 00:17:50.653
...disappeared!

00:17:50.653 --> 00:17:52.113
Fudo, this is...

00:17:52.113 --> 00:17:53.656
It's started.

00:17:56.534 --> 00:18:00.872
When the forbidden romance
crosses the last line,

00:18:00.872 --> 00:18:05.168
the waves released by Aquarion
go beyond all space and time.

00:18:05.168 --> 00:18:09.089
This is precisely love gone out of control!

00:18:14.594 --> 00:18:16.346
What's this...?

00:18:16.346 --> 00:18:20.975
Images are flowing in through the punch?

00:18:20.975 --> 00:18:22.727
I've never seen this place.

00:18:22.727 --> 00:18:24.354
Where on earth is this place?

00:18:25.730 --> 00:18:26.898
Who's that?

00:18:26.898 --> 00:18:28.817
He's like a beast.

00:18:40.537 --> 00:18:42.163
Those two...

00:18:44.541 --> 00:18:45.917
Aquarion?!

00:18:45.917 --> 00:18:49.754
But it's somehow different from our Aquarion.

00:18:50.922 --> 00:18:55.343
Now that... is Sousei Gattai!

00:18:55.343 --> 00:18:56.594
Fudo Supreme Commander?!

00:18:56.594 --> 00:18:58.930
It's true that man resembles him, but...

00:19:04.436 --> 00:19:06.396
Lovely...

00:19:06.396 --> 00:19:11.776
This truly is the light of my beloved Solar Wing!

00:19:11.776 --> 00:19:15.363
The light of hope that will
bring us back to power!

00:19:16.948 --> 00:19:18.408
He is...

00:19:18.408 --> 00:19:21.077
I feel like I've seen him before.

00:19:21.077 --> 00:19:23.413
But I can't remember.

00:19:26.666 --> 00:19:27.792
From Aquarion...

00:19:27.792 --> 00:19:28.877
Wings came out!

00:19:28.877 --> 00:19:33.298
Could that be...
the legendary Mythic Aquarion?!

00:19:37.552 --> 00:19:38.636
Apollo!

00:19:38.636 --> 00:19:40.638
Thank you, Silvia!

00:19:40.638 --> 00:19:42.974
--Apollo...
--Silvia...?

00:19:42.974 --> 00:19:45.352
Not Silffy?

00:19:45.352 --> 00:19:49.898
Your familiar fragrance... I'll never forget it!

00:19:51.066 --> 00:19:52.567
Apo...

00:19:56.112 --> 00:20:00.950
If all goes well, let's meet again
in another 12,000 years!

00:20:03.453 --> 00:20:05.246
Apollo!

00:20:17.258 --> 00:20:19.094
Is it possible...

00:20:19.094 --> 00:20:21.054
...this is...

00:20:21.054 --> 00:20:23.598
...the truth of twelve thousand years ago...?

00:20:28.186 --> 00:20:29.688
Wh-What?!

00:20:46.413 --> 00:20:49.457
What happened?! What's the island's status?!

00:20:49.457 --> 00:20:52.043
Signals clear! Image will transmit shortly!

00:20:56.131 --> 00:20:57.966
No way...

00:20:57.966 --> 00:21:01.678
The entire island is gone...

00:21:01.678 --> 00:21:04.055
We've confirmed all the Elements!

00:21:04.055 --> 00:21:07.017
Both Gepart and Evol are okay!

00:21:09.144 --> 00:21:12.731
The desire to know the truth...

00:21:12.731 --> 00:21:16.234
...and the desire to seek true love...

00:21:16.234 --> 00:21:22.490
The integration of these two desires
has awakened another forbidden power.

00:21:24.200 --> 00:21:29.039
Oh, no! Someone! Hurry up and help us!

00:21:30.123 --> 00:21:34.336
The Mugen Punch flew through space...

00:21:34.336 --> 00:21:37.589
Yeah, and that's not all.

00:21:37.589 --> 00:21:41.593
Even my Instant Prediction
couldn't pick up on it.

00:21:41.593 --> 00:21:47.140
Don't tell me... it flew through time itself?

00:21:47.140 --> 00:21:51.186
Just how much stronger will Aquarion get?

00:21:52.520 --> 00:21:55.982
Good. It seems like Cayenne
and the others are okay, too.

00:21:55.982 --> 00:21:59.569
But what crazy power we unleashed...

00:21:59.569 --> 00:22:01.780
It's my fault.

00:22:01.780 --> 00:22:04.783
Because I said I was in love,

00:22:04.783 --> 00:22:09.788
the forbidden power got invoked
and Evol went out of control.

00:22:09.788 --> 00:22:13.917
It could've ended up killing everyone...

00:22:18.129 --> 00:22:22.175
At any rate, that guy we saw earlier...

00:22:25.387 --> 00:22:30.809
If those truly were scenes from
twelve thousand years ago...

00:22:30.809 --> 00:22:33.978
Apollo... He was like a beast...

00:22:35.271 --> 00:22:38.400
...just like that guy who's after Mikono.

00:22:42.153 --> 00:22:46.950
Overcoming fate... Can I really do it?

00:23:02.882 --> 00:23:10.807
<i>Kimi e tsuzuku sakamichi ni</i>
<i>shiroi hana ga saiteta</i>

00:23:10.807 --> 00:23:18.440
<i>Yume kara sameta ato mo kanashii sora miteta</i>

00:23:23.028 --> 00:23:28.825
<i>Kono kimochi happa no ura ni sunderu</i>

00:23:30.410 --> 00:23:38.251
<i>Asatsuyu ga ochiru oto ni mimi o sumaseteru no</i>

00:23:38.251 --> 00:23:46.051
<i>Kami sama anata ga tsukutta</i>
<i>sekai wa kanpeki ja nai</i>

00:23:46.051 --> 00:23:53.850
<i>Koko de wa mainichi koi ga</i>
<i>poroporo shinde yuku</i>

00:23:53.850 --> 00:23:57.687
<i>Hajimete suki ni natta no</i>

00:23:57.687 --> 00:24:00.982
<i>Anata wa shiranai desho</i>

00:24:00.982 --> 00:24:05.445
<i>Chikyuu no uragawa de ii kara</i>

00:24:05.445 --> 00:24:08.656
<i>Soba ni ite hoshikatta</i>

00:24:08.656 --> 00:24:13.119
<i>Watashi o wasurete mo ii kara</i>

00:24:13.119 --> 00:24:19.209
<i>Soba ni ite hoshikatta</i>

00:24:23.797 --> 00:24:26.883
What?! Really?! Next week's
episode will be a swimsuit episode?!

00:24:26.883 --> 00:24:28.259
Will Cayenne wear a red loincloth?!

00:24:28.259 --> 00:24:30.428
And Shrade will wear a wet, see-through shirt?!

00:24:30.428 --> 00:24:33.181
Ahh! I've gotta set my DVR to record it!

00:24:34.265 --> 00:24:35.266
"Next Episode 'Well Up, Life'"
Next on <i>Aquarion Evol</i>!

00:24:35.266 --> 00:24:37.163
"Next Episode 'Well Up, Life'"
"Well Up, Life."
